<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="33e8dbd4">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Read specifications and discuss options with the document’s author (if available) and other project team members
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop a technical solution, identifying existing standard package components that must be accessed and any new
        components that must be created
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Write the necessary code to achieve the goals specified in the functional specifications while following coding
        guidelines and naming conventions as specified
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Create accompanying documentation by documenting important or complex functionality that may need to be referenced
        later by the maintenance and support team
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conduct unit testing to verify the correct build of the components
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Update requirements traceability matrix and update object names to the associated design specifications and
        requirement IDs&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
